        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"electronpositron-annihilation-into-two-photons\">Electron\u2013positron annihilation into two photons</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><a href=\"/\">Browse all notebooks</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"/?file=hep/compton.py\">Compton scattering</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Generate both diagrams for <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(e^-e^+\\to\\gamma\\gamma||)</marimo-tex>, retaining the electron\nmass and their interference. Average the two incoming spins and sum the\nphoton polarizations using shared Feynkit, Spenso and Idenso operations.\nThe result agrees with the\n<a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/QED/Tree/ElAel-GaGa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FeynCalc example</a>.\nThe kinematics obey <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s+t+u=2m_e^2||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
